        {
          "book": "DAN",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 15
        }
      ],
      "en": "Then these men assembled together to the king, and said to the king, “Know, O king, that it is a law of the Medes and Persians, that no decree nor statute which the king establishes may be changed.”",
      "ko": "그 무리들이 또 모여 왕에게로 나아와서 왕께 말씀하되 왕이여 메대와 바사의 규례를 아시거니와 왕의 세우신 금령과 법도는 변개하지 못할 것이니이다",
      "source_text_hash": "76da10a95aedcb0b4ff74a399730536a911a0a093e9c4d483420b9260b6fa3b3",
      "translation_text_hash": "8fd6cf9da751b5cf0dcd2858c3674d72d2c276e35f454923548759c98ef0563d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
