        {
          "book": "DAN",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 23
        }
      ],
      "en": "Then the king was exceedingly glad, and commanded that they should take Daniel up out of the den. So Daniel was taken up out of the den, and no kind of harm was found on him, because he had trusted in his God.",
      "ko": "왕이 심히 기뻐서 명하여 다니엘을 굴에서 올리라 하매 그들이 다니엘을 굴에서 올린즉 그 몸이 조금도 상하지 아니하였으니 이는 그가 자기 하나님을 의뢰함이었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "3f0632eb6b2a6789e63ecd82d69f6de185edcc92139c8dd0204d14fccd377993",
      "translation_text_hash": "cff0c96e3b9227c81a045d5350a3c8926daa894754ac5997effb8ce804e7a20a",
